<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Thank you for contacting Arizona State University.&nbsp;</font><font face="arial">Currently, ASU does not offer or accept application fee waivers. The application fee to apply to ASU is $70 and can be paid online at the time a student applies or can be sent in as a check or money order. Please let me know if you have any other questions. &nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.FirstName}&nbsp;{!User.LastName}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Title}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>